D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-4-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:5:运行 `NfTurboBusinessApplication`（nft-turbo-app 模块），调用 `POST /trade/newBuy` 接口后，`InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener.executeLocalTransaction()` 未被触发，断点不命中。
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-6-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-7-## 根因
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-8-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:9:`nft-turbo-app` 模块的 `application.yml` 中 `spring.cloud.function.definition` **覆盖**了 `nft-turbo-trade` 模块的定义，导致 `newBuy-out-0` 生产者绑定的 RocketMQ 事务消息配置未生效。
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-10-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-11-### 调用链路
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-12-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-13-```
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:14:POST /trade/newBuy
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:15:  → TradeController.newBuy()
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:16:    → StreamProducer.send("newBuy-out-0", tag, msg)
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-17-      → StreamBridge.send() 发事务消息
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-18-        → RocketMQ 回调 InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener.executeLocalTransaction()
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-19-```
