D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-23-| 配置项 | nft-turbo-trade（被覆盖） | nft-turbo-app（生效） |
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-24-|--------|--------------------------|---------------------|
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:25:| `function.definition` | `newBuy;newBuyPlus;...` | `chain;orderClose;heldCollection` |
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:26:| `stream.rocketmq.bindings.newBuy-out-0` | ✅ `producerType: Trans` + `transactionListener: inventoryDecreaseTransactionListener` | ❌ 未配置 |
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-27-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:28:Spring Boot 多模块加载时，主应用的 `application.yml` 中同名字符串属性 `spring.cloud.function.definition` 会覆盖依赖模块的值，导致 `newBuy` 未注册。
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-29-
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md:30:`newBuy-out-0` 的事务生产者配置（`producerType: Trans`、`transactionListener`）虽然在 trade 模块的 yml 中有定义，但由于依赖模块的 yml 加载优先级低于主应用，实际未被 Spring Cloud Stream 识别。`StreamBridge.send("newBuy-out-0", ...)` 发送的是**普通消息**而非事务消息，`TransactionListener` 永远不会被触发。
D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\nfturbo-master\issue\InventoryDecreaseTransactionListener-not-invoked.md-31-
